  "deprecatedOn": "2026-09-23",
  "replacedBy": "https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/substrates/sheet-materials/paper/paper-fibre/recycled-fibre",
  "deprecationReason": {
    "en": "Recycled is a fibre origin, not a surface: a recycled paper has a surface of its own (matte, silk …), so it moved to the new facet paper-fibre (recycled-fibre). Product envelopes now carry supportsSubstrateFibre instead.",
    "nb": "Resirkulert er fiberopphav, ikke overflate: et resirkulert papir har sin egen overflate (matt, silk …), så verdien er flyttet til den nye fasetten paper-fibre (recycled-fibre). Produktmalene bærer nå supportsSubstrateFibre i stedet."
  }
}
